//   - The original implementation scanned the input one character at a time
//     while juggling a header level, a list counter, an "item open" flag and
//     a "header emitted" flag. The rewrite below processes the document line
//     by line, which makes each rule obvious in isolation.
//   - Emphasis conversion ("__" -> <strong>, "_" -> <em>) is still applied
//     to the whole document before structural parsing, exactly as before.
func Render(markdown string) string {
